es in `istio-cni` and `ztunnels` deployed in kube-system)\r\n- replace bombardier loadgenerator with vegeta, which allows loadgen client to do dns caching\r\n- remove the operator deployment method in istio/ambient-demo as it is no longer supported", "tree": {"sha": "5babb55d6e7d887cd392b3f3cd7bc7c2b83f6b2e", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/solo-io/aoa-catalog/git/trees/5babb55d6e7d887cd392b3f3cd7bc7c2b83f6b2e"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/solo-io/aoa-catalog/git/commits/99760d717b3c59f40454318971b3c090a804e5d1", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJl86fBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAApeoQAFyutvVo+2m3oKLjCbiESSm4\nmI0Z1E7MP85ewde8aaUpJJx7MYlgYT5lIEQACCnJt3+5AmlfS7V94AXoG+rM8WKj\nzl0C0gABmUtwv8ysKft2OVMVQnUFupMP/SVKBVY/l2emO53m9+GILu9zGdQNhick\nmyri3K0bwM6H/8p+0dWKrj8aOPzQ9RAeGggDATt6xOAxIqKVABIxfukBT1q9OBUL\nA43vx39Pbgiuca15olgmUdQ9nMZAiZxTlpZMNlftu0BXTz6N3DzCR27BzoFnzNRA\nXjSVlOrdfK+jejO5c2jWDlz4aRkTeBaSjD+Ehv+FPsEgPDEvq2Y1aWYOBDtvOXHC\n6Z+MXtXChZs9WKAuWiuE5BzAwL/ktddGe3Hs0Np+uJWAU4KU7rYhAdh/zk2VDF6a\n/2m752ikGqDTjN0alSxVa4OH65ppYPq9RDOo1GyK/ERvs/At1KRG3Ve73HrDT3Af\n0jm32Q7rQYs/vjHe55yKUMthaRMGul5PG49+lkEHaPPveEX+jBBgdlmCgAl0YWEx\nK6bc+MNHCLXsjnTP1nz3jNsV8+e+fUy/YrhMexUtYvaRjwrxW/aPJ7Qz/Y2y5dpT\npc/7kIghBR8RBCGD+P2G3TUNJDYrscua/doCPOw9ljFiAbv2Y3gy9ja0WNdNfF5h\nk73fUdd80E+CFKWSQEaQ\n=Ku20\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree 5babb55d6e7d887cd392b3f3cd7bc7c2b83f6b2e\nparent 172fc8ec6d4a8c8072638422e9a879e8927e2250\nauthor Alex <31321277+ably77@users.noreply.github.com> 1710467009 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1710467009 -0700\n\nsee CHANGELOG (0.2.6) (#116)\n\n0.2.6 (3-13-24)\r\n---\r\n- update /istio/ambient-demo environment to 1.21.0 \r\n    - Support for any CNI now available upstream\r\n    - This makes it possible to test ambient an ambient environment locally on k3d or colima+k3s using the `-i` or `-i --colima` flag\r\n- update istio/ambient-demo with a few new variations\r\n    - `/core` -\r\n    - `/random-generated-apps` - non-uniform applications with cross namespace communication. Default is across 5 namespaces\r\n    - `/uniform-apps` - isolated applications per-namespace with the pattern A > B1/B2 > C1. Default is across 5 namespaces\r\n    - `/gke` - this environment configures the `/uniform-apps` but with GKE specific requirements for ambient mesh (additional values in `istio-cni` and `ztunnels` deployed in kube-system)\r\n- replace bombardier loadgenerator with vegeta, which allows loadgen client to do dns caching\r\n- remove the operator deployment method in istio/ambient-demo as it is no longer supported", "verified_at": "2024-11-07T18:29:25Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/solo-io/aoa-catalog/commits/99760d717b3c59f40454318971b3c090a804e5d1", "html_url": "https://github.com/solo-io/aoa-catalog/commit/99760d717b3c59f40454318971b3c090a804e5d1", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/solo-io/aoa-catalog/commits/99760d717b3c59f40454318971b3c090a804e5d1/comments", "author": {"login": "ably77", "id": 31321277, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjMxMzIxMjc3", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31321277?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77", "html_url": "https://github.com/ably77", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/ably77/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "